WEBVTT

00:04:59.828 --> 00:05:01.309
they would have let me.

00:05:01.694 --> 00:05:03.243
And here's the thing:

00:05:03.267 --> 00:05:04.911
before I met them,

00:05:04.935 --> 00:05:09.833
I assumed that Mongolian nomads
were hospitable out of kindness

00:05:09.857 --> 00:05:11.565
like anybody else.

00:05:11.589 --> 00:05:14.503
But then I realized it was more than that.

00:05:15.132 --> 00:05:18.180
It was about surviving as a community.

00:05:18.204 --> 00:05:22.459
Because nomads live
in extremely remote areas,

00:05:22.483 --> 00:05:25.056
they are completely
at the mercy of nature.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:28.048
Heavy snowfall,

00:05:28.072 --> 00:05:29.429
a sudden flood

00:05:29.453 --> 00:05:30.998
or a raging storm